# Git commit conventions

Do **not** add `Co-authored-by:` trailers to commit messages in this repository.

Commit messages should contain only the subject line and body written for the human author. Never append:

```
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```

or any similar co-author attribution for AI/agent assistance.
